  "plan_source": "task 071",
  "sheet_prompt": "One illustration of 4 separate characters arranged in 2 rows of 2, evenly spaced across a single seamless background.\nSubject: cute puupy.\nStyle: flat vector illustration, bold clean shapes, solid vibrant colours, friendly proportions.\nOutline: none. Draw every character directly on the background with no outline, border, stroke, die-cut edge or halo around it.\nReading left to right, top to bottom, every character is a different moment: a wide range of emotions AND different states of action (standing, walking, running, jumping, sitting, lying down, leaning, reaching, spinning), so no two characters share a pose, a body position or a silhouette:\nCharacter 1: beaming with happiness, bouncing on the spot with a huge smile\nCharacter 2: laughing so hard tears of joy fly out, holding the belly\nCharacter 3: bawling with big streaming tears, rubbing the eyes\nCharacter 4: sad and slumped, head hanging low, a single tear\nMake every expression big and readable at small size: exaggerated eyes, eyebrows, mouth and body language.\nConsistency: the same character design, proportions and colours for all 4 characters.\nBackground: a single, seamless, solid pure green (#00FF00) background covering the whole image in exactly one shade, with no tiled panels, no shading variations, no tint, gradient, vignette or glow, no shadows, no floor, no noise.\nSpacing: every character is full body with a generous empty margin on every side (at least 20% of its own size), clearly separated from the others, none touching or crossing another.",
  "video_prompt": "Animate this 2x2 sheet of characters as a 3-second clip.\nCreate a very expressive animation of each character, each having its own personality with a wide range of emotions.\n1. bounces happily, the smile widens, a little hop\n2. doubles over laughing, shoulders shake, wipes a tear\n3. tears stream in two arcs, the body shakes with sobs\n4. sighs, the shoulders drop, a tear slides down\nEach character moves only inside its own cell. Empty cells stay empty. Static camera.\nKeep the flat green background and every character's design unchanged.",
